ill flee from the epicenter instead.Doom's cooldown resets upon respawning.","Innate - Gloom: Nearby enemy champions and monsters that dash or blink will be marked with Gloom for 6 seconds. Vex's next basic attack, which becomes non-projectile, or basic ability hit against an enemy with Gloom will detonate the mark. Looming Darkness will also inflict Gloom, but cannot detonate it.","Gloom's detonation deals 40 : 150 (based on level) (+ 25% AP) bonus magic damage and refunds 25% of Doom's cooldown. Against non-champions, this instead deals 40% / 45% / 50% / 55% / 60% (based on level) damage and refunds 10% of Doom's cooldown."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Mistral Bolt","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[70,115,160,205,250],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[70,70,70,70,70],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":[]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Personal Space","rows":[{"attribute":"Shield Strength","modifiers":[{"values":[50,75,100,125,150],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[75,75,75,75,75],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[80,120,160,200,240],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[30,30,30,30,30],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Vex can move during Personal Space's cast time."]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Looming Darkness","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[50,70,90,110,130],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[40,45,50,55,60],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Slow","modifiers":[{"values":[30,35,40,45,50],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Killing an enemy with Looming Darkness refunds 10% of Doom's cooldown, increased to 25% for champion kills."]}]},{"slot":"R","variants":[{"name":"Shadow Surge","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[75,125,175],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[20,20,20],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[150,250,350],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[50,50,50],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Total Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[225,375,525],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[70,70,70],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Shadow stops upon hitting an enemy champion to mark them for 4 seconds, during which they are revealed. Shadow Surge can be recast while the target is marked.","If Vex scores a takedown against Shadow Surge's marked target within 6 seconds of its application, Vex can cast Shadow Surge again within 12 seconds at no cost after 0.5 seconds."]}]}],"formulaVersion":"15.15.1","history":[{"patch":"26.13","date":"2026-06-23","articleDate":"2026-06-23","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/league-of-legends-patch-26-13-notes/#patch-vex","changes":[{"slot":"E","title":"E - 커지는 어둠","text":"재사용 대기시간 : 13초 ⇒ 12초","kind":"buff"},{"slot":"R","title":"R - 그림자 파동","text":"초기화 가능 시간 : 6초 ⇒ 8초","kind":"buff"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"14.5","date":"2024-03-05","articleDate":"2024-03-05","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-14-5-notes/#patch-champions","changes":[{"slot":"P","title":"기본 지속 효과 - 파멸과 우울","text":"우울 표식 폭발 피해량 : 30~140 (레벨에 따라) (+주문력의 20%) ⇒ 40~150 (레벨에 따라) (+주문력의 25%)","kind":"buff"},{"slot":"E","title":"E - 커지는 어둠","text":"신규이제 E - 커지는 어둠으로 유닛을 처치하면 기본 지속 효과 - 파멸과 우울의 재사용 대기시간 감소 효과가 적용됩니다.","kind":"adjust"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"13.17","date":"2023-08-29","articleDate":"2023-08-29","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-13-17-notes/#patch-vex","changes":[{"slot":"Q","title":"Q - 안개 화살","text":"마법 피해량 : 60/105/150/195/240 (+주문력의 70%) ⇒ 70/115/160/205/250 (+주문력의 70%)","kind":"buff"},{"slot":"W","title":"W - 거리 두기","text":"재사용 대기시간 : 20/18/16/14/